            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JILLY3544"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a very nice and easy recipe, that my family enjoyed. It is much like bread pudding, and I think next time I make it I will add more spices, such as pumpkin pie or apple spices, to kick up the flavor a bit."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cynthia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used a whole loaf of bread to make this. It made 16 cups of bread pieces. So I just increased the other ingredients for the amount of bread my loaf made. I ended up having to use my big roasting pan to accommodate for the amount of ingredients I had. I also had to increase the baking time as 1 hour was not long enough. OMG...it turned out amazing!!! This is definitely in my list of keepers.",
